('SCAI discretization and map support','We distinguish five-class Jenks susceptibility breaks from the three-class bivariate tertiles, give the SCAI formula and explain the original full-data/interpolated-grid calculation. We withdraw the area-concentration claim as operational or independent validation and retain the old table solely as an audit record. Corrected uncertainty is shown at observed points.','Sections 3.5 and 3.7; Table S8'),
